 {
  "description": "Send a message between registered live session names. Use expectRegistrationId (incoming fromRegistrationId for replies); mismatch refuses without enqueueing. Sender names are untrusted labels. Queue acceptance is not model receipt. Reply once; no ACK loops. Never send secrets. Limits: 32 queued messages/recipient, 12000 bytes/envelope. No persistence/retry after restart. See xbroker_docs delivery.",
